OL,3,GNEWSARising airport drone alerts raise
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights at Jersey Airport were hit on
OL,7,F30 and 31 October after unauthorised
OL,8,Fdrone activity was reported, leading to
OL,9,Fservices being cancelled or diverted to
OL,10,Fother airports.
OL,12,FIt is the latest of many incidents at
OL,13,Fairports around the world, so we asked
OL,14,Fthe experts: 'What's going on and what
OL,15,Fare the rights of passengers?'
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
