OL,3,GNEWSARising airport drone alerts raise
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"You can go on to Amazon, you can buy
OL,7,Frelatively small drones for a couple of
OL,8,Fhundred pounds, if not less," said
OL,9,FDaniel Clarke, chief technology officer
OL,10,Fat StirlingX which helps airport
OL,11,Foperators detect drones and locating
OL,12,Fthe people flying them.
OL,14,FThe growing popularity of low-cost
OL,15,Fdrones is contributing to an increase
OL,16,Fin disruptions at airports across the
OL,17,FUK and Europe, according to Clarke.
